      "description": "Introducing the Keto Golden Milk Latte, a delicious and nourishing beverage that brings together a medley of ingredients renowned for their health benefits. This golden elixir is not just a soothing and comforting drink but also a powerhouse of nutrients that can positively impact your overall well-being.\n\nAt its core, this is a blend of almond milk and a medley of aromatic spices like turmeric, ginger, and cinnamon. The star of the show, turmeric, infuses the latte with its vibrant color and potent anti-inflammatory properties. Almond milk and heavy cream together offer healthy fats that can support brain health and provide a satisfying creamy texture. With the addition of protein, we ensure your smoothie doubles as a satisfying meal replacement.\n\nWhether you’re sipping it as a a revitalizing morning pick-me-up or a soothing bedtime ritual (without the espresso), this recipe offers plenty of possibilities to make it your own!\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\n1 1/4 cups unsweetened almond milk\n1/4 cup heavy cream\n1 ounce unflavored protein powder\n1/2 teaspoon turmeric\n1/4 teaspoon ground cinnamon\n1/4 teaspoon ground ginger\npinch of black pepper\npinch of salt\n1/2 ounce espresso, ~2 shots\n7 drops liquid stevia\n\nNutrition Summary: This makes a total of 1 serving of Keto Golden Milk Latte Shake. The serving comes out to be 346 calories, 25.2g fats, 4.2g net carbs, and 25.6g protein.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 14 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
